 assessment).\n\nDesign decisions to nail down:\n\n1. Record component name and position: `Optional<BigDecimal> breakEvenCumulativeFundingRate` placed right after `incrementalIncomeVsSimpleEarn` (grouping the comparison metrics together).2. Service computation: in the existing else-branch (no blockers, no unknowns):\n```javabreakEvenCumulativeFundingRate = Optional.of(\n simpleEarnIncome.add(knownCost)\n .divide(request.hedgedShortNotional(), CALCULATION_CONTEXT));\n```\nAvailability identical to `estimatedFundingOnlyNetIncome`/`incrementalIncomeVsSimpleEarn` (same branch). Empty in all other branches. No re-derivation anywhere else.\n\nAlso worth noting a mathematical invariant for tests: at threshold, incremental ==0, because notional × threshold − knownCost − simpleEarnIncome ==0 (within DECIMAL128 rounding for non-terminating cases — for the exact0.02 sample it's exactly0; for non-divisible cases, only approximately; tests for the invariant should use the exact sample).\n\n3. CLI display: one new line after \"相对简单赚币增量\":\n```javaout.println(\"90天累计资金费率阈值=\" + result.breakEvenCumulativeFundingRate()\n .map(AssessIncomeCliRunner::percent).orElse(\"无法精确计算\"));\n```\nFormat: reuse existing `percent()` (×100,6 decimals HALF_UP, \"%\") → \"2.000000%\". Label explicitly says累计/90天 so it can't be read as APR or per-settlement rate. Unavailable case prints \"无法精确计算\" consistent with net income lines; reasons already printed via blockers/unknowns lines above. Extend the final限制 line with a clause clarifying the threshold is a historical break-even point, not a forecast — appended text keeps existing `contains` assertions passing. Actually careful — existing test asserts `.contains(\"区间完整性尚未证明\")` on the限制 line; appending more text to that line is safe. But minimal-change discipline: is modifying the限制 line necessary? AC-4 requires \"清楚标注...及不可用情况\" — the label handles that. The user request says the doc carries the limitations. But a short clause guarding against APR misreading is cheap and directly addresses contract Risk Area1. I'll propose appending to the existing限制 line: \"；资金费率阈值仅是同口径历史追平点，不是年化或预测\". Keep it as one clause, no new line. Hmm, alternatively add it to the threshold line itself. A cleaner option: print the threshold line as `90天累计资金费率阈值=2.000000%（整个90天累计，非APR、非单次费率）`? That's verbose per output. I'll go with appending the clause to the trailing限制 line — single change point, and the trailing line is the standard place for caveats.\n\nWait, one formatting consideration: `percent()` gives \"2.000000%\". Fine.\n\n4. Tests (TR-1/TR-2 in service test):\n - `breakEvenThresholdMatchesIndependentSampleAndRateBoundaries`: capital20000, APR0.0365, costs complete with knownTotal20 (opening aggregate20, exit/slippage/rebalance/service all0), notional10000, EXIT_TO_USDT, terms confirmed. Single settlement at0.019 → simpleEarnIncome180, threshold0.02, incremental −10, PREFER_SIMPLE_EARN; at0.020 → incremental0 (isEqualByComparingTo0 and signum()==0), PREFER_SIMPLE_EARN; at0.021 → +10, MICRO_VALIDATE_ARBITRAGE. Assertions on BigDecimal raw values (isEqualByComparingTo), never on CLI-rounded strings.\n - `breakEvenThresholdBoundaries`: zero known cost (all-zero complete costs) → threshold == simpleEarnIncome/notional ==180/10000 =0.018; zero APR (apr0, cost20) → threshold ==20/10000 =0.002, ...","signature":null}},{"ToolUse":{"id":"call_cdd78c216f8346febb776577","name":"Read .agent/workstreams/ws-20261026T142203Z-7SNA/artifacts/contracts/node-contract-compile-007/contract-resolution.md","raw_input":"{\"file_path\":\"/Users/kriswang/work/projects/ai/codex-claude-ai-workflow/dual-orchestrator/output/w09-okx-next-e2e-gate-20261026/fixture/case/worktree/.agent/workstreams/ws-20261026T142203Z-7SNA/artifacts/contracts/node-contract-compile-007/contract-resolution.md\"}","input":{"file_path":"/Users/kriswang/work/projects/ai/codex-claude-ai-workflow/dual-orchestrator/output/w09-okx-next-e2e-gate-20261026/fixture/case/worktree/.agent/workstreams/ws-20261026T142203Z-7SNA/artifacts/contracts/node-contract-compile-007/contract-resolution.md"},"is_input_complete":true,"thought_signature":null}},{"Thinking":{"text":"The contract is approved. Now I'm ready to produce the final design JSON. Let me compose it carefully per the output contract.\n\nFinal check of the JSON structure:\n- schema_version:1- workstream_id, run_id, node_id- result: artifact_type, decision, summary, lifecycle_status, checks[], evidence[], missing_evidence[], must_fix[], open_risks[], verification_summary, design.planned_files[], revision_responses[]All human-readable strings in Simplified Chinese. No markdown wrapping.","signature":null}},{"Text":"{\"schema_version\":1,\"workstream_id\":\"ws-20261026T142203Z-7SNA\",\"run_id\":\"run-1793027503466\",\"node_id\":\"design.claude_design\",\"result\":{\"artifact_type\":\"design_result\",\"decision\":\"READY_FOR_ARCH_REVIEW\",\"summary\":\"在 PhaseOneAssessmentService既有充分证据分支内新增与增量比较同可用条件的“90 天累计资金费率追平阈值”typed 字段，CLI 只读展示并附中文使用说明与配套测试。\",\"lifecycle_status\":\"READY\",\"checks\":[\"已读取经人工门批准的 Task Contract（APPROVE），设计严格对齐 AC-1 至 AC-5、TR-1 至 TR-4、约束与排除项，不触碰采集、迁移、持仓、调度、组合策略、Web 页面与 Dual 生产代码。\",\"计算口径核对：阈值 =(simpleEarnIncome + costs.knownTotal())/hedgedShortNotional，与既有增量路径共用同一分子口径，不重复计费；该值是与 fundingHistory.holdingReturn 同单位的整个90 天累计费率，任何位置都不做 APR化、按结算次数或假定8 小时间隔换算。\",\"独立验算 AC-2样例：20000×0.0365×90/365=180；阈值=(180+20)/10000=0.02；累计费率0.019/0.020/0.021 时资金费收入190/200/210，扣除成本20 后净收入170/180/190，既有同口径增量恰为 -10/0/+10 USDT，0.02 为精确终止小数。\",\"可用性语义核对：阈值仅在 blockers 与 unknowns均为空的既有充分证据分支（条款已确认、窗口内有已实现结算、成本完整、terminal-policy=exit-to-usdt）计算，其余分支一律 Optional.empty，与 estimatedFundingOnlyNetIncome/incrementalIncomeVsSimpleEarn完全一致，沿既有 blockers/unknowns 说明原因，不填0、不猜数。\",\"零或非法名义金额复用 PhaseOneAssessmentRequest既有校验（hedgedShortNotional.signum()<=0抛 IllegalArgumentException，发生在读取事实之前），不新增校验路径。\",\"精度规则显式：分子为既有 DECIMAL128计算的 simpleEarnIncome 加精确 knownTotal，除法使用与服务既有一致的 MathContext.DECIMAL128（34 位有效数字，非终止小数安全）；record存原始未舍入值，CLI 仅展示层用既有 percent()（×100、6 位小数、HALF_UP）格式化，舍入值绝不回流影响建议。\",\"构造点核查：全仓库仅 PhaseOneAssessmentService构造 PhaseOneAssessment record；DecisionWorkbenchController 只经服务评估并按访问器消费（smartView），新增组件对 Web 只读路径无影响、无需修改。\",\"生命周期边界适用性声明：本设计仅新增一次 assess()调用内的纯派生不可变值，无索引、锁、事务、队列、缓存、外部副作用或补偿，评估保持只读、不创建 analysis_run；并发、超时、中断、重启、回滚与防绕过边界均不适用且不因本变更改变。\",\"回归边界：既有建议逻辑、首次小额验证上限5000 USDT、成本与未知项语义、退出码与限制提示全部保持不变；CLI既有断言基于 contains，追加限制子句不破坏现有测试。\"],\"evidence\":[\"src/main/java/app/cryptoincome/assessment/application/PhaseOneAssessmentService.java:42-50（simpleEarnIncome/knownCost既有口径）与 :79-101（三分支证据判定；阈值计算落在 :87-91 的 else 分支，与 netIncome/incremental 同时置值）。\",\"src/main/java/app/cryptoincome/assessment/domain/PhaseOneAssessment.java:7-21：新组件 Optional<BigDecimal> breakEvenCumulativeFundingRate拟插入 incrementalIncomeVsSimpleEarn 之后、evidenceStatus之前。\",\"src/main/java/app/cryptoincome/assessment/domain/PhaseOneAssessmentRequest.java:38-40既有 hedgedShortNotional>0 校验；SmartArbitrageCosts.java:29-50 knownTotal()/unknowns()决定分子口径与不可用原因。\",\"src/main/java/app/cryptoincome/cli/AssessIncomeCliRunner.java:160-163（净收益/增量“无法精确计算”展示惯例）、:183（限制行）、:305-307（percent() 格式化）：新阈值行置于增量行之后，未可用时打印“无法精确计算”，理由已由上方未知项/阻断项行给出；限制行追加一句“阈值是同口径历史追平点，不是年化或预测”。\",\"src/test/java/app/cryptoincome/assessment/PhaseOneAssessmentServiceTest.java 与 src/test/java/app/cryptoincome/cli/AssessIncomeCliRunnerTest.java：现有 fixture 结构（service()/request()/completeCosts()/completeArguments()）可直接扩展承载 TR-1/TR-2/TR-3。\",\"docs/README.md 编号惯例01–14，新说明文档沿用为 docs/15-Funding-Rate-Break-Even-Threshold.md（与合同 Risk Areas建议一致）。\",\"数学不变量（测试锚点）：hedgedShortNotional×阈值 = simpleEarnIncome+knownTotal，故累计费率恰等于阈值时既有增量精确为0（仅终止小数样例精确成立；除不尽场景按 DECIMAL128 后 setScale(6,HALF_UP)断言）。\",\"合同依据：.agent/workstreams/ws-20261026T142203Z-7SNA/artifacts/contracts/node-contract-compile-007/task-contract.md（AC/TR/约束/风险区）与 contract-resolution.md（human_gate APPROVE，2026-10-26T15:11:09Z）。\"],\"missing_evidence\":[],\"must_fix\":[],\"open_risks\":[\"CLI展示值依赖 DECIMAL128 除法结果，测试以“标签+6 位小数百分比”的正则/包含断言为准，不在 CLI测试中重算数值，避免展示口径二次实现。\",\"TR-4完整基线回归含 Testcontainers MySQL，执行阶段需 Docker 可用，并以 Maven Surefire报告作为程序化通过依据；该验证属后续执行节点，本设计阶段未运行。\"],\"verification_summary\":\"仅设计阶段：完成代码与合同核对及样例手工验算，未实现代码、未运行测试。\",\"design\":{\"planned_files\":[{\"path\":\"src/main/java/app/cryptoincome/assessment/domain/PhaseOneAssessment.java\",\"operation\":\"MODIFY\",\"responsibility\":\"在 incrementalIncomeVsSimpleEarn 之后新增组件 Optional<BigDecimal> breakEvenCumulativeFundingRate（90 天累计资金费率追平阈值，未舍入 DECIMAL128原值），仅承载 typed 结果，不引入新校验或逻辑。\"},{\"path\":\"src/main/java/app/cryptoincome/assessment/application/PhaseOneAssessmentService.java\",\"operation\":\"MODIFY\",\"responsibility\":\"在既有无阻断且无未知项的充分证据分支计算 simpleEarnIncome.add(knownCost).divide(hedgedShortNotional, CALCULATION_CONTEXT) 并置入新字段；其余分支保持 Optional.empty；建议、上限、blockers/unknowns语义完全不变。\"},{\"path\":\"src/main/java/app/cryptoincome/cli/AssessIncomeCliRunner.java\",\"operation\":\"MODIFY\",\"responsibility\":\"只读展示新字段：在“相对简单赚币增量”行后新增一行“90天累计资金费率阈值=<percent 或 无法精确计算>”，并在末尾限制行追加“同口径历史追平点，非年化、非预测”子句；不重算、不影响建议与退出码。\"},{\"path\":\"src/test/java/app/cryptoincome/assessment/PhaseOneAssessmentServiceTest.java\",\"operation\":\"MODIFY\",\"responsibility\":\"TR-1/TR-2：独立样例（对照收益180、阈值0.02，累计费率0.019/0.020/0.021 对应增量 -10/0/+10，断言基于 BigDecimal原值）；零已知成本（0.018）、零 APR（0.002）、负资金费率仍可用、除不尽精度（如名义3000 得0.066667）；成本缺失/条款未确认/无历史结算/期末保持开放时阈值为空且沿 blockers/unknowns；零与负名义金额在读取事实前被既有校验拒绝。\"},{\"path\":\"src/test/java/app/cryptoincome/cli/AssessIncomeCliRunnerTest.java\",\"operation\":\"MODIFY\",\"responsibility\":\"TR-3：完整证据时输出含“90天累计资金费率阈值=”及6 位小数百分比数值；证据不足时输出“90天累计资金费率阈值=无法精确计算”且不打印数值；既有建议文案、首次实盘上限、退出码与限制提示断言保留不回归。\"},{\"path\":\"docs/15-Funding-Rate-Break-Even-Threshold.md\",\"operation\":\"CREATE\",\"responsibility\":\"简体中文使用说明：定义与公式、AC-2样例与0.019/0.020/0.021边界表、可用与不可用条件、BigDecimal/DECIMAL128精度与仅展示层舍入规则、历史情景限制（非预测、非建议、区间完整性未证明），并指向 docs/09测试手册。\"}]},\"revision_responses\":[]}"}],"tool_results":{"call_8810446e8e0e44dc8edba7f1":{"tool_use_id":"call_88